Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:47.85,EN,,0,0,0,,She's a good public speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,她很会公开演讲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:51.79,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:51.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,我之前不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.74,EN,,0,0,0,,And maybe, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许，你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,the last time I heard Mirka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我上次听米尔卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:58.00,EN,,0,0,0,,speak publicly was probably
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,公开说话大概是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.14,EN,,0,0,0,,at our mixed doubles we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我们打霍普曼杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,played at the Hopman Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,的混双时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:08.30,EN,,0,0,0,,24 years ago, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概24年前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,After one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,打完一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:10.58,EN,,0,0,0,,of our mixed doubles, we had
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,混双后，我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.74,EN,,0,0,0,,to do an interview together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.58,0:01:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,要一起接受采访
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:12.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:12.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许那是她最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:13.34,EN,,0,0,0,,she spoke publicly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,公开说话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:15.86,EN,,0,0,0,,So this is very well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这次说得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:16.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:17.62,EN,,0,0,0,,if you've been, sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是不是，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:18.82,EN,,0,0,0,,secretly practicing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,偷偷练过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:20.82,EN,,0,0,0,,but this is very high level
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,但水平非常高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and a tough act to follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,难以超越
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm so happy you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我很高兴你做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:26.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And also a shout out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要致敬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:37.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to Fred Stolle who actually
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗雷德·斯托勒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,did the interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,他做了采访
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.32,EN,,0,0,0,,also Hall of Famer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是名人堂成员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:44.08,EN,,0,0,0,,So that was obviously special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.32,0:01:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以那显然很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:50.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Let me just give a shout out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我也向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:51.30,EN,,0,0,0,,to Mary as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,玛丽致敬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:52.48,EN,,0,0,0,,That was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,那太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:55.22,EN,,0,0,0,,You crushed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,你太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:00.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So many stories, emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:02:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么多故事、情感
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:01.82,EN,,0,0,0,,laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:01.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:01.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:02.66,EN,,0,0,0,,on your whole team
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:02.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们整个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and your whole family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,和你的所有家人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:04.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.54,EN,,0,0,0,,who has supported you along
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁一直支持着你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.70,EN,,0,0,0,,the way. When I look,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:08.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,一路走来。回首此刻，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:13.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm thrilled to have made
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很激动能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:20.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the journey here to the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到这里，走进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.54,EN,,0,0,0,,International Tennis Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.52,0:02:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,国际网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:22.52,EN,,0,0,0,,of Fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,名人堂。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.52,0:02:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.76,EN,,0,0,0,,this is a beautiful place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是个美丽的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and I've really enjoyed every
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的每一刻都很享受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:27.96,EN,,0,0,0,,minute so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:27.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,到目前为止的每一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:31.42,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, of course I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当然有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You've got grass courts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里有草地球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以是我的最爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:35.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I was always going to have a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直都会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,wonderful time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,度过美好时光
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.84,EN,,0,0,0,,The museum is just incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,博物馆真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I really encourage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的鼓励
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.06,EN,,0,0,0,,everyone who comes here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个来这里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,都去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:43.46,EN,,0,0,0,,There's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,那里有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,so much tennis history,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多网球历史
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,rackets, trophies,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,球拍、奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.36,EN,,0,0,0,,iconic outfits from the greats
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,传奇球星的经典战袍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and they say they've got
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.36,0:02:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们还说有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.70,EN,,0,0,0,,more than, I was told,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:53.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,超过，有人告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.30,EN,,0,0,0,,25,000 artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,25,000件藏品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.98,EN,,0,0,0,,and now I guess I am one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在我想我也
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:00.96,EN,,0,0,0,,of them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是其中一员了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:03.94,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's amazing to see yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说，看到自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.98,EN,,0,0,0,,in a place like this to walk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:05.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,置身这样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.94,EN,,0,0,0,,through the Hall of Fame,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,走过名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to immerse myself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,沉浸在这项
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.24,EN,,0,0,0,,in the history of this sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,运动的历史中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.84,EN,,0,0,0,,That means everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,To read the stories
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,读到那些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,of my greatest heroes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我最敬仰的英雄们的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and to realize,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,并且意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:18.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean to truly realize
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说真正意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:19.28,EN,,0,0,0,,for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.60,0:03:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that I have a place here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这里也有一席之地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,This is one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:22.30,EN,,0,0,0,,of the greatest honors
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我人生中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,最大的荣耀之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:25.24,EN,,0,0,0,,They call this the Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.08,0:03:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里有个称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of Fame,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:29.32,EN,,0,0,0,,but fame was never the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:29.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但名气从来不是目标
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:30.78,EN,,0,0,0,,My goal was to spend my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的目标是用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.54,EN,,0,0,0,,life doing something I love,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,一生做自己热爱的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,like what Mirka said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:34.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,正如米尔卡所说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.02,EN,,0,0,0,,with people who love it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,和那些深爱它的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.86,EN,,0,0,0,,as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们爱得和我一样深
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,And so many of those people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且其中很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.62,EN,,0,0,0,,are here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天都在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Family, friends
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,家人、朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.58,EN,,0,0,0,,who mean everything to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们对我无比重要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,fans who have traveled here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,远道而来的球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,来和我们相聚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Some maybe over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些也许在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I saw you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我之前看到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Give me a shout out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,给我打个招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:55.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮我撑撑场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.38,EN,,0,0,0,,They still show me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们依然给我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,so much support
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常大的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:07.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for so many years and wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么多年了，哇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.58,EN,,0,0,0,,what a privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,真是荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:10.86,EN,,0,0,0,,to be with so many legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,能和这么多传奇同台
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:11.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. So many legends
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,不好意思 这么多传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:13.82,EN,,0,0,0,,are all sitting right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,都坐在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,此时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that we're here together, I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,既然大家齐聚于此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.26,EN,,0,0,0,,can tell you what it really took
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你真正需要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,to get into the Hall of Fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能进入名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's look at the numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,来看看这些数字
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Not the obvious stats,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是那些显而易见的统计数据
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.96,EN,,0,0,0,,like the number of majors
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,比如大满贯数量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:26.26,EN,,0,0,0,,or number of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者排名世界第一的周数
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Number one, I'm talking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界第一，我说的是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:28.04,EN,,0,0,0,,about the numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些真正能说明问题的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that really paint a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,它们能描绘出全貌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:31.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Between 1998
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,从1998年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and when I first went
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,我第一次踏上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.26,EN,,0,0,0,,on the ATP tour
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,ATP巡回赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:37.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and when I retired in 2022,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,到2022年退役
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I wore more than 5,000
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我职业生涯戴过的头带
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:43.66,EN,,0,0,0,,headbands in my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,超过5000条
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,That's more than Borg and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,甚至超过博格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:48.14,EN,,0,0,0,,McEnroe combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:48.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,与麦肯罗两人的总和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, Johnny Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错，强尼·麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:54.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I think it's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:54.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说，我觉得不止如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:55.60,EN,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知为何
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.64,EN,,0,0,0,,the tour doesn't keep count
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛不统计
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:57.48,EN,,0,0,0,,of the headbands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,发带的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我当然自己数
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.70,EN,,0,0,0,,If you think that's impressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.92,0:05:01.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得那很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:02.70,EN,,0,0,0,,I wore probably
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我大概穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,over 7,000 pairs of socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,七千多双袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.90,EN,,0,0,0,,That's probably twice as many
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,那可能是两倍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,as most of my opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,比我大多数对手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:11.82,EN,,0,0,0,,because I doubled them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:11.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我穿两双
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.66,EN,,0,0,0,,And at one time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.06,EN,,0,0,0,,in my first -round match
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我的首轮比赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,at Wimbledon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在温布尔登
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I was so nervous I even wore
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我紧张得甚至穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,three pairs of socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,三双袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:21.50,EN,,0,0,0,,I realized after the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.72,0:05:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后我才发现
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:23.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, my stringers strung
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,此外，我的穿线师们穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,about 10,000 rackets
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,大约10,000把球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.06,EN,,0,0,0,,over 25 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,历时25年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.26,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's two tight stringers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,这要归功于两位出色的穿线师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Ron and Nate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,罗恩和内特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:32.04,EN,,0,0,0,,But really, there's no way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:32.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但说真的，根本无法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.86,EN,,0,0,0,,to measure what it means
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,衡量来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.54,EN,,0,0,0,,It's hard to put it into words,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难用语言表达
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:37.94,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:37.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I've had the privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.02,EN,,0,0,0,,of walking onto the grass
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,走上草地球场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of Centre Court
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,在中央球场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.46,EN,,0,0,0,,at Wimbledon, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然是在温布尔登
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,looking up at Mirka
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,抬头看着米尔卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:47.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and our four kids, Myla,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:47.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,和我们的四个孩子，米拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Charlene, Leo, and Lenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,夏琳、利奥和莱尼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,seeing my parents, Robbie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到我的父母，罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and Lynette, seeing my team
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有莱内特，看到我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and looking across the net
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,再看向球网对面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and seeing some
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到一些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,of the greatest competitors
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,最伟大的竞争者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.72,EN,,0,0,0,,who have ever played
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们曾驰骋于
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.94,EN,,0,0,0,,the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,网坛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:05:59.42,EN,,0,0,0,,I've had the privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:05:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有这样的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.90,EN,,0,0,0,,of stepping onto the red clay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,踏上红土球场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.34,EN,,0,0,0,,of Roland Garros
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,来到罗兰·加洛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,for the French Open,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,征战法国网球公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.30,EN,,0,0,0,,the privilege of looking up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有幸抬头仰望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.64,EN,,0,0,0,,at thousands of tennis fans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,万千网球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:08.44,EN,,0,0,0,,in Melbourne Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,在墨尔本公园
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,For the Australian Open,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,澳大利亚网球公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:12.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of course, that is the US Open
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然还有美国网球公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.24,EN,,0,0,0,,at Flushing Meadows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,在法拉盛草原
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:16.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and Tuesday night was epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,周二晚上太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:17.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:18.68,EN,,0,0,0,,for playing part in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,参与其中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And then, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.24,0:06:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后当然
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.30,EN,,0,0,0,,the ATP Finals in Houston,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,休斯顿的ATP年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Shanghai and London.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,上海和伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:26.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Images like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,像这样的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.52,EN,,0,0,0,,these are imprinted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,都深深印在脑海里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.30,EN,,0,0,0,,in my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的脑海里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and they're all part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,它们都是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.60,EN,,0,0,0,,of me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,如今我的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Yet, when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,然而，当我闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and think and dream
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,思考和梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:36.06,EN,,0,0,0,,of the game I love,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我热爱的比赛时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.36,EN,,0,0,0,,here's what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看到了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I just need a sip for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得喝一口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.56,EN,,0,0,0,,One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:44.60,EN,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:44.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm in Basel, Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在瑞士巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:46.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm 13 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我13岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:49.10,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's the Swiss indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:49.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是瑞士室内赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not competing. I'm a ball
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是球童
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm standing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是站着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:53.36,EN,,0,0,0,,against the back wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:53.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,背靠着后墙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:54.24,EN,,0,0,0,,hands behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,双手放在身后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,eyes on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,眼睛盯着球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我永远不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:57.78,EN,,0,0,0,,the game looked from there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:57.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,从那里看比赛的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:59.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and how it felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:06:59.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,和那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:00.08,EN,,0,0,0,,The thrill of standing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:00.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,站得那么近的兴奋感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so close to the players,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,离球员那么近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.70,EN,,0,0,0,,feeding them the ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,给他们喂球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:04.12,EN,,0,0,0,,handing them the towel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,给他们递毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.62,EN,,0,0,0,,seeing them sweat,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,看他们流汗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:06.92,EN,,0,0,0,,watching them fight it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,看他们拼搏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,figure it out, the adversity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,想办法应对逆境
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种强度
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:11.94,EN,,0,0,0,,I remember the next morning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,my legs were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的腿完全没力气了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:14.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Standing all day is a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,站一整天真的很
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,累
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So I really want
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank every ball kid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢每一位球童
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:19.30,EN,,0,0,0,,who ever stood
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:19.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们曾经站着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,through my matches, or all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,看完我的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.24,EN,,0,0,0,,our matches for that matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们的比赛也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:26.04,EN,,0,0,0,,for hours on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:26.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,一打就是好几个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.97,EN,,0,0,0,,I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.59,EN,,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.57,EN,,0,0,0,,I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也曾是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:33.89,EN,,0,0,0,,By the time I was 13,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,到我13岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.27,EN,,0,0,0,,I had been in love with tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,我已经爱上网球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.11,EN,,0,0,0,,for a decade already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,整整十年了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:38.01,EN,,0,0,0,,My parents tell me I picked
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.11,0:07:38.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,我父母说我三岁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.01,EN,,0,0,0,,up a racket when I was three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,就拿起了球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.43,EN,,0,0,0,,My dad's wooden racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.01,0:07:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我爸爸的木拍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:42.27,EN,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:42.65,EN,,0,0,0,,I grew up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:42.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从小
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:44.03,EN,,0,0,0,,with the wooden rackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:44.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,用的是木拍子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.09,EN,,0,0,0,,And white tennis balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:45.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有白色网球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:48.63,EN,,0,0,0,,That's how old I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:48.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,说明我有多老
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:50.09,EN,,0,0,0,,And that racket was so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.63,0:07:50.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个拍子特别重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:50.91,EN,,0,0,0,,I used to play double -handed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:50.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以前正手双手握拍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.99,EN,,0,0,0,,forehand and double -handed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,反手也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.01,EN,,0,0,0,,backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,双手握拍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:54.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Who knew I was going
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.01,0:07:54.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁知道后来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:55.15,EN,,0,0,0,,to become
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.77,0:07:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会变成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.97,EN,,0,0,0,,a single -handed player?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,单手选手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:07:59.37,EN,,0,0,0,,And are there any
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:07:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在还有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:00.19,EN,,0,0,0,,one -handers left
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,单手球员吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:01.47,EN,,0,0,0,,in the game today
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,如今的网坛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.57,EN,,0,0,0,,or here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者今晚在场的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:04.79,EN,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.53,EN,,0,0,0,,We're the proud few guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们是骄傲的少数人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:08.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:09.91,EN,,0,0,0,,And Switzerland was honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,瑞士老实说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:11.49,EN,,0,0,0,,an amazing place to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,是个很棒的成长之地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.19,EN,,0,0,0,,My parents gave
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,我父母给了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:13.99,EN,,0,0,0,,my sister Diana and me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:13.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,我和我姐戴安娜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:15.95,EN,,0,0,0,,a wonderful childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个美好的童年
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:16.93,EN,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of support
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有很多支持
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:20.13,EN,,0,0,0,,to do what I love to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:20.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,去做我热爱的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:20.93,EN,,0,0,0,,And as a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:20.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:21.95,EN,,0,0,0,,that meant hitting balls
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.93,0:08:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,那意味着打球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:25.93,EN,,0,0,0,,against bedroom cupboards,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:25.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,对着卧室的柜子击球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:26.83,EN,,0,0,0,,my grandparents' garage
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:26.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,祖父母的车库
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.41,EN,,0,0,0,,door, and all the walls
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,门，还有所有的墙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.75,EN,,0,0,0,,at the tennis clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,在网球俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.79,EN,,0,0,0,,It meant playing football
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,也意味着踢足球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:32.53,EN,,0,0,0,,with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,和朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:34.45,EN,,0,0,0,,I was Maradona or Zidane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是马拉多纳或齐达内
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:36.11,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm playing basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:36.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,打篮球时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.07,EN,,0,0,0,,I was Jordan or Shaq,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是乔丹或奥尼尔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:37.91,EN,,0,0,0,,of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:37.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:38.79,EN,,0,0,0,,We had the Walkman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们还有随身听
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:39.77,EN,,0,0,0,,on while we rode
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:39.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我们滑滑板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:41.09,EN,,0,0,0,,our skateboards and bikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,和骑自行车的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.61,EN,,0,0,0,,And after all, it was the 80s
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且毕竟是80年代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:43.71,EN,,0,0,0,,and the 90s.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,和90年代
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:44.91,EN,,0,0,0,,We played table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们打乒乓球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:45.67,EN,,0,0,0,,We played badminton
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们打羽毛球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.01,EN,,0,0,0,,over the fence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,隔着篱笆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:48.67,EN,,0,0,0,,with our neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.01,0:08:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟邻居一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:49.17,EN,,0,0,0,,And for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:50.77,EN,,0,0,0,,I even had a cricket bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:50.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,我甚至有板球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:51.85,EN,,0,0,0,,But tennis, for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:51.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,但网球对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.75,EN,,0,0,0,,was the main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,才是重头戏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:54.73,EN,,0,0,0,,Tennis became the fabric
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球成了我生活的底色
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:56.55,EN,,0,0,0,,of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:56.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,贯穿我的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:57.49,EN,,0,0,0,,Mom had a full -time job,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:57.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,妈妈有份全职工作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:08:58.31,EN,,0,0,0,,but she found time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:08:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她还是挤出时间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.07,EN,,0,0,0,,to work the badge office
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,在赛事证件处工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:01.03,EN,,0,0,0,,for the Swiss indoors
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:01.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,为瑞士室内赛工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:01.41,EN,,0,0,0,,and probably
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:01.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能还
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:01.97,EN,,0,0,0,,did some badges
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许你们当年的证件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.15,EN,,0,0,0,,for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:03.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,也出自她手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:04.81,EN,,0,0,0,,So she was also the one
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:04.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以也是她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:05.99,EN,,0,0,0,,who organized my lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:05.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮我安排了课程
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.19,EN,,0,0,0,,to sign me up for matches
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.99,0:09:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,给我报名比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:09.17,EN,,0,0,0,,and supported my coaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,还支持我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.49,EN,,0,0,0,,Mom made it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:10.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,妈妈促成了这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:13.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:19.98,EN,,0,0,0,,And she played tennis herself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,她自己也在我们当地俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:21.72,EN,,0,0,0,,at our local club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,打过网球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:22.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been told
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我听说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.68,EN,,0,0,0,,my dad played too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸也打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:28.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:28.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.42,EN,,0,0,0,,He can take a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:29.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,他开得起玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.50,EN,,0,0,0,,He likes to joke around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,他喜欢开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks to both my mom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢我的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and dad for all the time spent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,和爸爸花的所有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.26,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,在球场上陪我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,What I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我印象最深的是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.72,EN,,0,0,0,,was my dad's total ban
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸完全禁止
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.86,EN,,0,0,0,,on moon balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,打月亮球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,When I played him, he had
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我跟他打的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.76,EN,,0,0,0,,the old continental grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:42.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,他用的是老式大陆式握拍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,That made me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这让我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.18,EN,,0,0,0,,for sure a more aggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,无疑让我变得更敢进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,tennis player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球选手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad, Robbie Federer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢爸爸，罗比·费德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:53.62,EN,,0,0,0,,the real RF.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:53.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正的 RF
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:02.90,EN,,0,0,0,,On our street next
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.64,0:10:02.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在我们街上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to the community gardens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,挨着社区花园
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:04.74,EN,,0,0,0,,my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and I would use chalk to draw
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会用粉笔画
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.96,EN,,0,0,0,,a court and stretch out a net
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个球场 拉一张网
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and play mini tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,打迷你网球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.54,EN,,0,0,0,,with a softball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,用的是软球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:13.06,EN,,0,0,0,,We played deep
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一直打到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:14.02,EN,,0,0,0,,into the summer nights
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,夏夜很深
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,or longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,甚至更晚
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And that word, play,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,而玩这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.54,EN,,0,0,0,,says a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,说明了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.46,EN,,0,0,0,,We play tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.28,EN,,0,0,0,,We're tennis players.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们是网球选手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,That, for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,is what it's about, the sense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键就是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,玩的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, this sport takes work
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 这项运动需要努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and practice, but the sense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,和练习 但玩的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:32.24,EN,,0,0,0,,of play always carried me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直支撑着我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:33.66,EN,,0,0,0,,And when the work
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,当努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.26,EN,,0,0,0,,and play blend together,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,和玩乐融为一体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.60,EN,,0,0,0,,that's the best feeling of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是最棒的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Which is why I turned pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是我转职业的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.10,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't see myself
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没把自己看作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,as a professional athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,职业运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I was a tennis player,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:43.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是网球选手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.42,EN,,0,0,0,,plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,说白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:45.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And I was part
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.42,0:10:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是这个圈子里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:45.62,EN,,0,0,0,,of a community
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.38,EN,,0,0,0,,of tennis players
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:49.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and tennis people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:49.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,和网球圈的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,It was on me whether I won
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.70,0:10:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢不赢都取决于我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:51.46,EN,,0,0,0,,or I lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是输球
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,I was the guy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.70,EN,,0,0,0,,on court serving, slicing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上发球、切削、
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:59.10,EN,,0,0,0,,smashing, winning, losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,扣杀、赢球、输球的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:00.34,EN,,0,0,0,,I loved that. But I also learned
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:00.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我喜欢那样。但我也学到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:01.98,EN,,0,0,0,,that tennis is never
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:01.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球从来不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,about the players alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是球员本身
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:05.32,EN,,0,0,0,,It's a whole ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:05.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一个完整的生态
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:05.90,EN,,0,0,0,,It's moms
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,有像我父母那样的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and dads like mine taking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,和爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:09.18,EN,,0,0,0,,their kids to matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.48,0:11:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,带孩子去看比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,cheering them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,给他们加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It's coaches
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有教练
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.66,EN,,0,0,0,,who teach children how
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,教孩子们如何
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:13.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to win and how
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.66,0:11:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,去赢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to bounce back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及如何重新振作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.18,EN,,0,0,0,,when they lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,在输球后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:16.66,EN,,0,0,0,,It's people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:16.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有人们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,who sweep the courts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有打扫球场的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:19.46,EN,,0,0,0,,or pick up the balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者捡球
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:20.54,EN,,0,0,0,,it's young players like me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,是像我这样的年轻球员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.00,EN,,0,0,0,,who get a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to be a ball kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.00,0:11:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,当球童
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:23.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And also, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有顺便说一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.34,EN,,0,0,0,,it's the linespeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有司线员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:26.30,EN,,0,0,0,,That's right. When I played
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错 我打球时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:28.52,EN,,0,0,0,,tennis, like with all of us here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我们在场所有人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,we used
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们以前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.34,EN,,0,0,0,,to have the linespeople,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,都有司线员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:31.40,EN,,0,0,0,,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:32.44,EN,,0,0,0,,And tennis is an ecosystem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球是一个生态系统
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of all those people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:38.06,EN,,0,0,0,,and, of course, the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然还有球迷们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:40.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Just making sure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:40.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是想确认
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.14,EN,,0,0,0,,we're still now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们现在依然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,with the night coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,随着夜晚来临
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:44.58,EN,,0,0,0,,we're still awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们还醒着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:45.22,EN,,0,0,0,,And the long speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有这长长的致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope it's not too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望不算太长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,And I was a tennis fan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,在成为球员之前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.18,EN,,0,0,0,,before I was a player
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是网球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm still a fan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在仍然是球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and will always be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且永远都是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And if you want
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果你们想要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to know how I played,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,想知道我打得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.12,EN,,0,0,0,,you can find the answer here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你可以在这里找到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.10,EN,,0,0,0,,at the Hall of Fame
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:59.16,EN,,0,0,0,,or on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者上 YouTube
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:11:59.94,EN,,0,0,0,,But if you want
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:11:59.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,但如果你想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:01.66,EN,,0,0,0,,to know why I played,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:01.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,知道我为什么打球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,the answer is found
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,答案要去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:03.90,EN,,0,0,0,,in Switzerland,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,瑞士寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.22,EN,,0,0,0,,on Waterhouse Street
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在瓦瑟豪斯街
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and at the Old Boys Club
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,在老男孩俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.94,EN,,0,0,0,,in Basel and at Swiss Tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,在巴塞尔和瑞士网球协会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:11.86,EN,,0,0,0,,in Écublan and Biel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,在埃居布朗和比尔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Why is a question I've asked
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,‘为什么’这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.39,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,我问过很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:16.95,EN,,0,0,0,,Pierre Paganini,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,皮埃尔·帕格尼尼，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:17.69,EN,,0,0,0,,my fitness trainer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:17.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的体能教练
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.37,EN,,0,0,0,,and mentor, will tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,兼导师，会告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.55,EN,,0,0,0,,that when I was at Écublan,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在埃居布朗的时候，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:22.41,EN,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:22.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,问过很多问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:24.49,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:24.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说，真的很多。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:25.19,EN,,0,0,0,,I nearly killed Pierre
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,我差点用好奇心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:27.01,EN,,0,0,0,,with my curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.19,0:12:27.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,把皮埃尔逼疯。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:27.21,EN,,0,0,0,,Pierre,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,皮埃尔，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:28.55,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful you survived
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:28.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢你在我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:30.25,EN,,0,0,0,,my time at Écublan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:30.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃居布朗期间活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:31.59,EN,,0,0,0,,Your invaluable guidance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:31.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,你宝贵的指导
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:32.71,EN,,0,0,0,,and long -term
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:32.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,和长期的规划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.15,EN,,0,0,0,,strategy helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮助了我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.07,EN,,0,0,0,,for my whole career.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:36.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,贯穿我整个职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.61,EN,,0,0,0,,That ball kid had a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个当过球童的孩子还有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.69,EN,,0,0,0,,to learn, skills and shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,要学，技巧和击球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.45,EN,,0,0,0,,stamina and strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,体能和策略
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:43.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, that kid
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有，那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.99,EN,,0,0,0,,had to learn not to throw
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,必须学会别老扔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.45,EN,,0,0,0,,his racket so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,他的球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:48.97,EN,,0,0,0,,Ideally, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:48.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好一次都别扔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:50.57,EN,,0,0,0,,Not to let his emotions get
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,别让情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:51.83,EN,,0,0,0,,the best of him to find
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:51.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,占据上风，还要找到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.31,EN,,0,0,0,,the balance between fire
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,在火与冰之间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:55.09,EN,,0,0,0,,and ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:55.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,找到平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:55.93,EN,,0,0,0,,And thankfully, I had a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:55.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,很幸运，我有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:57.79,EN,,0,0,0,,of incredible role models.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:57.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多了不起的榜样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:58.83,EN,,0,0,0,,Here's my personal Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:58.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,下面是我的个人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.31,EN,,0,0,0,,of Fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.33,EN,,0,0,0,,Pierre's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,皮埃尔也在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:02.47,EN,,0,0,0,,So are all my coaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:02.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的教练们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:03.09,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:03.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,我说的是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.75,EN,,0,0,0,,phenomenal Peter Carter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,非凡的彼得·卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:06.11,EN,,0,0,0,,super-cool Peter Lundgren,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,超酷的彼得·伦德格伦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:06.97,EN,,0,0,0,,two men who unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,两位不幸的男士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.65,EN,,0,0,0,,are no longer with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,已不在我们身边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:10.31,EN,,0,0,0,,who not only helped my game
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:10.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们不只提升了我的球技
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.57,EN,,0,0,0,,but helped me grow up fast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,也让我在旅途中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.57,0:13:12.61,EN,,0,0,0,,on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.57,0:13:12.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,迅速成长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:16.25,EN,,0,0,0,,I love you guys. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:16.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爱你们 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:25.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, legendary coaches
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有传奇的教练们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Jose Higueras, Paul Annacone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,何塞·伊格拉斯、保罗·安纳孔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and Tony Roach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有托尼·罗奇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I love my time with them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢和他们在一起的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:31.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and I learned
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.88,0:13:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我学到了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:32.50,EN,,0,0,0,,so much from their stories
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:32.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,从他们的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,和经验里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:35.38,EN,,0,0,0,,And I was lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.14,EN,,0,0,0,,to have my childhood hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,能有我儿时的偶像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:40.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Stefan Edberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯特凡·埃德伯格
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:49.15,EN,,0,0,0,,That's not a first, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:49.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,这可不是第一次了，对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:52.59,EN,,0,0,0,,God, those are happy tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:52.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,天哪，这是幸福的眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:53.39,EN,,0,0,0,,I had you in my corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:53.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,有你在我的团队里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:55.35,EN,,0,0,0,,who provided huge
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,你给了我巨大鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:57.13,EN,,0,0,0,,personal inspiration
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:57.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是个人层面的激励
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:58.47,EN,,0,0,0,,for the everyday grind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,支撑着我度过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.53,EN,,0,0,0,,on the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛上日复一日的磨砺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:01.53,EN,,0,0,0,,And my amazing friend Reto
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:01.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有挚友雷托·施陶布利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:02.47,EN,,0,0,0,,Staubli, who helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:02.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,他曾帮助我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:03.55,EN,,0,0,0,,during an amazing stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,走过一段非凡时期
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:04.69,EN,,0,0,0,,while balancing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.55,0:14:04.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时兼顾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:07.81,EN,,0,0,0,,his banking life with coaching
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,银行工作与执教
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.43,EN,,0,0,0,,and Ivan Ljubicic, who had a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有伊万·柳比契奇，他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.07,EN,,0,0,0,,tremendous impact working
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,与我合作的最后六年里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.35,EN,,0,0,0,,with me for the last six years
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,产生了巨大影响
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:16.95,EN,,0,0,0,,in the twilight of my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是我职业生涯的尾声
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:26.45,EN,,0,0,0,,It's getting tough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在越来越难了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:27.03,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought it was going
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以为这场
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:27.91,EN,,0,0,0,,to be easy, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:27.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,会很轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:30.39,EN,,0,0,0,,And Severin Lutti,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:30.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有塞弗林·吕蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:34.63,EN,,0,0,0,,my longest tenured coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.39,0:14:34.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,我任期最长的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:41.57,EN,,0,0,0,,18 long years together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起走过18个漫长的年头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:42.67,EN,,0,0,0,,Severin's role in my life
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:42.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,塞弗林在我人生中的分量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:43.95,EN,,0,0,0,,and my career is even bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:43.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,和职业生涯里的分量更大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:45.39,EN,,0,0,0,,than that number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.95,0:14:45.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,比那个数字还大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.49,EN,,0,0,0,,He kept me motivated
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:46.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,他一直激励着我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.11,EN,,0,0,0,,when I needed motivating
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我需要动力的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.57,EN,,0,0,0,,and he protected me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且他也保护着我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.95,EN,,0,0,0,,when I needed protecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我需要保护时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:08.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们会挺过去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:14.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Until the sun rises, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:14.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,直到太阳升起，伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yo, your insights
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.22,0:15:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的见解
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.64,EN,,0,0,0,,were super crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,至关重要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you to all my success.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢所有成就我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:23.46,EN,,0,0,0,,And together we had a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一起度过了美好时光
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:25.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Physios and my doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,理疗师和我的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Roland, are in my hall
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,罗兰也在我心中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:29.72,EN,,0,0,0,,of fame too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,的名人堂里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:40.33,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought I was doing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,刚才有那么一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.55,EN,,0,0,0,,so well for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:42.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己表现不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.79,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:44.91,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:47.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:49.93,EN,,0,0,0,,No, so I needed a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:49.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,不，我需要很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:52.35,EN,,0,0,0,,of the help from Roland,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:52.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,来自罗兰的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.29,EN,,0,0,0,,Danny, Steph,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,丹尼、斯蒂芬、
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:54.43,EN,,0,0,0,,Gary, Pavel, helped
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,加里、帕维尔，帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:57.11,EN,,0,0,0,,a young body get strong and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:57.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,让年轻的身体变强，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:59.81,EN,,0,0,0,,an old body keep working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,让年老的身体还能运转。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:00.73,EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all the good times
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们带来的美好时光
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:04.51,EN,,0,0,0,,and the late hours, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:04.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,和那些深夜，伙计们。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:08.97,EN,,0,0,0,,One at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:08.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,一次一个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.37,EN,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:11.49,EN,,0,0,0,,Almost there. Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,快到了，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.25,EN,,0,0,0,,Martina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,玛蒂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.15,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, any help at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的，现在任何帮助都行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:17.09,EN,,0,0,0,,but this is a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:17.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过这个办法不错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.83,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.53,EN,,0,0,0,,Tony is in my hall of fame
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,托尼也在我的名人堂里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:22.41,EN,,0,0,0,,and every athlete has people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:22.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个运动员身边都有人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:25.01,EN,,0,0,0,,who help shape a career.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:25.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮他们塑造职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:26.17,EN,,0,0,0,,Tony's done even more than
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,而托尼做的远不止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:26.37,EN,,0,0,0,,that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:27.85,EN,,0,0,0,,For over 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:27.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,二十多年来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.47,EN,,0,0,0,,he's helped me think bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,他帮我想得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:30.43,EN,,0,0,0,,and bolder
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,也更大胆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:31.19,EN,,0,0,0,,about the world beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:31.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,去看巡回赛之外
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:32.11,EN,,0,0,0,,the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.19,0:16:32.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,更大的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:32.99,EN,,0,0,0,,We've built things together
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:32.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一起做了些事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.11,EN,,0,0,0,,that make me incredibly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,令我无比
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:34.93,EN,,0,0,0,,proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:34.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:35.67,EN,,0,0,0,,New ventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,新的冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.15,EN,,0,0,0,,new partnerships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,新的合作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.07,EN,,0,0,0,,And along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,一路走来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.09,EN,,0,0,0,,the agent became a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,经纪人成了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:41.77,EN,,0,0,0,,and the friend became family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:41.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,朋友成了家人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:42.33,EN,,0,0,0,,That includes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,这包括
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.65,EN,,0,0,0,,your wonderful Mary Jo,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你了不起的玛丽·乔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:47.21,EN,,0,0,0,,who plays a special role.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,她也扮演着特殊角色
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:54.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Tony
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:54.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,托尼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:55.81,EN,,0,0,0,,and I have had the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:55.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,和我有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:56.33,EN,,0,0,0,,to develop
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,发展出
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:57.57,EN,,0,0,0,,the greatest relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.33,0:16:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,最棒的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.57,EN,,0,0,0,,with some
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,与一些
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:00.01,EN,,0,0,0,,of the greatest global brands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:00.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,全球顶级品牌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:00.45,EN,,0,0,0,,And I just want
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:00.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:01.31,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank my sponsors
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢我的赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:02.09,EN,,0,0,0,,and premium partners
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:02.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,和高级合作伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:02.97,EN,,0,0,0,,for believing in me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:04.89,EN,,0,0,0,,from the early days to today
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,从最初直到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.01,EN,,0,0,0,,and for being incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,也感谢你们如此出色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:07.07,EN,,0,0,0,,creative partners
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为我的创意伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.79,EN,,0,0,0,,who have become friends
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来又成为朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:09.93,EN,,0,0,0,,over the years, making life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:09.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这些年的巡回生活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.97,EN,,0,0,0,,on tour even much more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,更有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:15.35,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:16.51,EN,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:16.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:18.45,EN,,0,0,0,,that includes people like Roy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:18.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,也包括罗伊这样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:18.79,EN,,0,0,0,,who along
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,他与团队并肩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:19.59,EN,,0,0,0,,with other teammates
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,也和其他队友一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:20.51,EN,,0,0,0,,have supported me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:20.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,始终支持着我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:21.67,EN,,0,0,0,,with a million things
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:21.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,处理过无数事务
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:22.77,EN,,0,0,0,,over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:22.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么多年来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:23.57,EN,,0,0,0,,plus the many tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:23.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有众多赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.23,EN,,0,0,0,,directors and everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,总监和每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.97,EN,,0,0,0,,who supports them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.23,0:17:26.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,支持他们的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.27,EN,,0,0,0,,The ecosystem is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个生态太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:31.65,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:31.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.01,EN,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:36.37,EN,,0,0,0,,My hall of fame also includes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:36.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的名人堂也有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.57,EN,,0,0,0,,some official hall of famers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.37,0:17:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,一些正式入选的名人堂成员
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:39.89,EN,,0,0,0,,like Boris Becker,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:39.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,像鲍里斯·贝克尔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:40.67,EN,,0,0,0,,Stefan Edberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯特凡·埃德伯格
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:41.93,EN,,0,0,0,,I remember sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:41.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得坐在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:42.47,EN,,0,0,0,,on the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,在家里的地板上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:43.57,EN,,0,0,0,,in our living room,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:43.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我们的客厅里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:44.85,EN,,0,0,0,,watching those guys play
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:44.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,看着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.63,EN,,0,0,0,,in the Wimbledon finals again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,一次又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.69,EN,,0,0,0,,and again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.63,0:17:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,征战温网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.11,EN,,0,0,0,,And, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:50.97,EN,,0,0,0,,there was Pete Sampras,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,有皮特·桑普拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:53.45,EN,,0,0,0,,the best serve ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,史上最好的发球
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:54.15,EN,,0,0,0,,What a privilege
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:54.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,多么荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:57.77,EN,,0,0,0,,to have shared a court.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:57.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在同一片球场交手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Your turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:04.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:04.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And two—not one, but two—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有两位，不是一位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:07.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Martinas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:07.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,玛蒂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,First, Martina Hingis,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先是玛蒂娜·辛吉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Swiss like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,瑞士人，跟我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,World number one by the age
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,16岁就排名世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:17.70,EN,,0,0,0,,of 16, unlike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这我可比不上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:19.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And Martina Navratilova.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:19.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有玛蒂娜·纳芙拉蒂洛娃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:22.38,EN,,0,0,0,,her for winning 59 majors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:22.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,她拿过59座大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.22,EN,,0,0,0,,But in our house,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:23.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在我们家里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:23.62,EN,,0,0,0,,she's famous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,她最有名的是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,for inspiring Mirka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,激励了米尔卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:27.94,EN,,0,0,0,,to play tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:27.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,开始打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:46.01,EN,,0,0,0,,I need tissues
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,我需要纸巾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.65,EN,,0,0,0,,and sunglasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.01,0:18:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,和墨镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:48.17,EN,,0,0,0,,I need everything
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.65,0:18:48.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,我需要一切
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:49.83,EN,,0,0,0,,to protect me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:49.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,来保护自己
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.19,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:52.69,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:53.75,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:53.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的。好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.71,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. Now we're going
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,天哪。现在我们要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:58.33,EN,,0,0,0,,into the Mirka bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,进入米尔卡的部分了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,This is such...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:08.25,EN,,0,0,0,,This is such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.08,0:19:08.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真是一团糟。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.29,EN,,0,0,0,,So Martina inspired Mirka,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以是玛蒂娜激励了米尔卡，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.91,EN,,0,0,0,,and Mirka inspires me every
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,米尔卡每天都激励我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:12.87,EN,,0,0,0,,day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:12.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,日日如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:13.37,EN,,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,如你所知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.93,EN,,0,0,0,,Mirka is my wife, duh,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,米尔卡是我妻子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:17.67,EN,,0,0,0,,which is the greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:17.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,这实在太过轻描淡写
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:19.29,EN,,0,0,0,,understatement I can make.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:19.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是我最保守的表达
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:19.83,EN,,0,0,0,,Because she's also
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:19.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她也
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:21.91,EN,,0,0,0,,been my coach,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:21.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直当我的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:22.57,EN,,0,0,0,,my hitting partner
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.91,0:19:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的练球搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.65,EN,,0,0,0,,before matches, and sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛前也是，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:27.53,EN,,0,0,0,,man, my reality check,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:27.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是那个让我认清现实的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.01,EN,,0,0,0,,also my stylist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是我的造型师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:29.89,EN,,0,0,0,,I definitely needed one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:29.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时确实需要一个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.51,EN,,0,0,0,,at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:32.31,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.51,0:19:32.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许现在还是，我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:34.17,EN,,0,0,0,,But Mirka is the person
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,但米尔卡是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.47,EN,,0,0,0,,who showed me how
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我懂得怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.29,EN,,0,0,0,,to get more focused
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,对网球更专注
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:39.79,EN,,0,0,0,,about tennis and take joy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,也能尽情享受
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.41,EN,,0,0,0,,in everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球之外的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:41.93,EN,,0,0,0,,A wonderful mother
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:41.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,她也是一位好母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.83,EN,,0,0,0,,to our four kids who make
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们的四个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:44.67,EN,,0,0,0,,the impossible happen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:44.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,把不可能变成现实
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:45.99,EN,,0,0,0,,in all our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.67,0:19:45.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我们所有人的生活里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:46.73,EN,,0,0,0,,She and I grab
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:46.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,她和我抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:47.67,EN,,0,0,0,,each other's hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,彼此的手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:49.85,EN,,0,0,0,,and we run through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:49.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我们一起冲破墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:53.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So she's all of these things,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以她集合了所有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's my Hall of Fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是我的名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Although the list of legends
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过，为我铺路的传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,who paved the way is even longer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,名单其实还要长得多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.54,EN,,0,0,0,,than that: Laver, Emerson,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉沃尔、埃默森
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Rosewall, Borg, McEnroe,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,罗斯沃尔、博格、麦肯罗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Marc Rosset, who was like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,马克·罗塞特，他就像
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.50,EN,,0,0,0,,a brother to me on the tour
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.16,0:20:19.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛上的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,who won the Olympics
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,他为瑞士赢得奥运冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:22.62,EN,,0,0,0,,for Switzerland 16 years
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:22.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,早在16年前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.90,EN,,0,0,0,,before my man Stan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我的兄弟斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.10,EN,,0,0,0,,and I had the honor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,和我也有幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:26.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,做到同样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.94,EN,,0,0,0,,I learned from all of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从他们所有人身上学习
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and eventually I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,最终我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:29.94,EN,,0,0,0,,had to figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:29.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,必须搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,my own identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我自己的身份。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:34.46,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.22,EN,,0,0,0,,It feels like more downhill
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在应该轻松多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:39.22,EN,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:39.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Which evolved over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的身份也随时间演变
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:42.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and this meant one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,它曾有一种样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.26,EN,,0,0,0,,in 1998 when I became the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是在1998年
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Junior World Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我成为青少年世界第一时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:46.74,EN,,0,0,0,,That version
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:46.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个版本的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:49.16,EN,,0,0,0,,of me had bleach blonde hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,染了金色头发
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:50.32,EN,,0,0,0,,which has caused me a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:50.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,给我带来了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,of embarrassment to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,至今都感到尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.74,EN,,0,0,0,,It meant something different
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,意义不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in 2022 when I played
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,2022年我打
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:57.54,EN,,0,0,0,,my last match in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,在伦敦的最后一场时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:20:58.12,EN,,0,0,0,,That version
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:20:58.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个版本的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of me had 4,040 total sets
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经让这双膝盖承受了4,040盘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:02.08,EN,,0,0,0,,on his knees,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛的重压
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's just singles matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且那还只是单打比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:04.92,EN,,0,0,0,,It doesn't include
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:04.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,它不包括
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.58,EN,,0,0,0,,the doubles, qualies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.92,0:21:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,双打、资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Challengers, Futures, satellites,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,挑战赛、希望赛、卫星赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:13.46,EN,,0,0,0,,practice sets, same knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,训练盘——还是这双膝盖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Still got them, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,顺带一提，膝盖还好着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and if I fall, please catch me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果我跌倒 请接住我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,But at every stage
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在我职业生涯的每个阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.42,EN,,0,0,0,,of my career, I tried above all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我首先努力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:24.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to stay true to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,忠于自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and I tried to show my love
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,并努力展现我的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:26.50,EN,,0,0,0,,for the game
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,对这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.70,EN,,0,0,0,,because it really mattered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为它对我真的很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to me, and I also wanted it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我也希望它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:32.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to matter to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.80,0:21:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,对你也重要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:32.92,EN,,0,0,0,,To be worthy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,配得上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:33.82,EN,,0,0,0,,of your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的关注
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:34.62,EN,,0,0,0,,worthy of your attendance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,配得上你的到场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:35.94,EN,,0,0,0,,because people don't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为大家并不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.72,EN,,0,0,0,,have to come watch us play.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.94,0:21:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,非得来看我们打球
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:39.70,EN,,0,0,0,,They come to be entertained,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们来是为了娱乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:41.70,EN,,0,0,0,,inspired, excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:41.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,被激励，感到兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:42.62,EN,,0,0,0,,They could always decide
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们随时可以决定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to go somewhere else,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,去别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:45.58,EN,,0,0,0,,but they chose tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,但他们选择了网球
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,they chose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们选择了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I played,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我所到之处
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:48.98,EN,,0,0,0,,you made me feel like I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:48.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们让我感觉好像
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,had home court advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我拥有主场优势
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted people
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直希望人们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:53.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to see how great it feels
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:53.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看这感觉有多棒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to play this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,打网球这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:56.44,EN,,0,0,0,,how great it feels
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.44,0:21:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉有多棒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:58.54,EN,,0,0,0,,to have a ball hit hard at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,球狠狠朝你飞来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:21:59.58,EN,,0,0,0,,the way it spins,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:21:59.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,它旋转的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.46,EN,,0,0,0,,the sound it makes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,它发出的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.03,EN,,0,0,0,,the way it bounces,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,它的弹跳方式
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:03.46,EN,,0,0,0,,how geometry shifts
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,几何关系如何变化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:05.70,EN,,0,0,0,,as the ball moves
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,当球移动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.96,EN,,0,0,0,,towards you and how
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,向你而来，以及
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.74,EN,,0,0,0,,the court itself opens
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,球场本身打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,or shrinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,或缩小
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Tennis is a complex
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:13.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and beautiful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是件美丽的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:15.54,EN,,0,0,0,,It is spectacular to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.34,0:22:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,看起来太壮观了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:17.26,EN,,0,0,0,,You're the fan, you see it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是球迷 全都看在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:19.54,EN,,0,0,0,,You live it with us every point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:19.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分你都和我们一起经历
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,As you know, there's a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道 网球里有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of pressure in tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,很大压力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,a volcano of pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,像火山一样的压力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.18,EN,,0,0,0,,volcano of emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,像火山一样喷涌的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:26.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and when the match
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,而比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:28.54,EN,,0,0,0,,was over, win or lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,结束的时候 不管输赢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:30.16,EN,,0,0,0,,you probably saw what I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你可能看到了我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,was feeling inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,内心的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:34.22,EN,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:34.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还能说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:34.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Tennis meant the world
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:34.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球对我来说意味着全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,to me, not just playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是打球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,not just winning,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:39.62,EN,,0,0,0,,but creating something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:39.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,而是创造新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It's a mentality I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我的一种心态
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:43.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I used to play serve and volley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以前打发球上网
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I had a transition game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.32,0:22:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也打过衔接进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I played way behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时站在远离
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:48.84,EN,,0,0,0,,the baseline sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.64,0:22:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,底线的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:50.42,EN,,0,0,0,,or on top of the baseline,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,或压在底线上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.42,0:22:51.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and I would even try
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.42,0:22:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我甚至会尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:53.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to sneak up on my opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,偷偷逼近对手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.46,EN,,0,0,0,,on my return, and some call it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.72,0:22:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在接发时，这后来被叫作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.16,EN,,0,0,0,,the SABR today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,如今被称作SABR
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.70,EN,,0,0,0,,This is what was important
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:59.50,EN,,0,0,0,,to me on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,球场上对我重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:00.10,EN,,0,0,0,,but so much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:00.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还有许多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:02.78,EN,,0,0,0,,of what was really important
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正重要的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,happened off the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,都发生在球场之外
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:05.70,EN,,0,0,0,,The camaraderie
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,比如那份情谊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:06.78,EN,,0,0,0,,in the locker room,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,发生在更衣室里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:07.94,EN,,0,0,0,,guys, playing cards
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:07.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,伙计们打牌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,with the team until
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,和团队一起，一直待到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:09.62,EN,,0,0,0,,the last second
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:09.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:11.14,EN,,0,0,0,,before matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:11.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:13.02,EN,,0,0,0,,laughing with everyone, even
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:13.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,和大家一起笑，甚至
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.02,0:23:14.70,EN,,0,0,0,,my opponents sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.02,0:23:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时和对手也笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.70,0:23:15.26,EN,,0,0,0,,So many of us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.70,0:23:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们很多人都
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:17.14,EN,,0,0,0,,have become friends through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,通过共同的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:18.30,EN,,0,0,0,,our shared experiences
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,成为了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:19.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and battles on the court
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:19.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有球场上的较量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:21.38,EN,,0,0,0,,that connect us through life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.44,0:23:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,把我们的一生相连
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:21.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Those are some
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:22.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of the best memories
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在巡回赛上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:23.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of playing on tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:23.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,最美好的回忆之一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:35.62,EN,,0,0,0,,But there's another kind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:35.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还有另一种
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:36.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.62,0:23:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,玩乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:38.10,EN,,0,0,0,,The kind that happens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.84,0:23:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是另一种快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:38.92,EN,,0,0,0,,with friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,和朋友一起时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.92,0:23:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and especially family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.92,0:23:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其和家人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Family again, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是家人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,With Mirka,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,和米尔卡一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,we started out doing things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们最初会一起做些事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:48.02,EN,,0,0,0,,like playing video games
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像打游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and doing clubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.02,0:23:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有泡夜店
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.83,0:23:53.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.83,0:23:53.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦，是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And having late dinners
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有和朋友一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:55.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:55.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,吃很晚的晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:56.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Then it shifted
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来这些变成了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:59.18,EN,,0,0,0,,into changing diapers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.52,0:23:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,换尿布
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and staying in hotels
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有入住酒店
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,with elevators, big enough
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些电梯得足够大
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,for double strollers,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,能放下双人婴儿车
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:05.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and goodnight stories
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有睡前故事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:06.66,EN,,0,0,0,,with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.34,0:24:06.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟孩子们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Myla, Charlene, Leo, and Lenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.66,0:24:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,米拉、夏琳、利奥和莱尼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:08.78,EN,,0,0,0,,you definitely changed
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们确实改变了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:10.98,EN,,0,0,0,,And you inspired us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:10.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们激励了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:12.26,EN,,0,0,0,,make us...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:14.12,EN,,0,0,0,,You inspire and make us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们激励着我们 让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.02,EN,,0,0,0,,happy every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,每天都开心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:19.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:25.81,EN,,0,0,0,,Our family
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.81,0:24:27.13,EN,,0,0,0,,has traveled together across
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.81,0:24:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起走遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:28.13,EN,,0,0,0,,the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:28.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.13,0:24:28.85,EN,,0,0,0,,Yep, we always return
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.13,0:24:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的，我们总会回到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.85,0:24:30.95,EN,,0,0,0,,to our home country,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.85,0:24:30.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们的祖国
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:32.01,EN,,0,0,0,,Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:32.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,瑞士
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:32.63,EN,,0,0,0,,It has always
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.01,0:24:32.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直以来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.63,0:24:33.47,EN,,0,0,0,,been an immense honor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.63,0:24:33.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是莫大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:34.41,EN,,0,0,0,,to represent the flag
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,能代表
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.41,0:24:35.03,EN,,0,0,0,,of Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.41,0:24:35.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,瑞士
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.03,0:24:38.31,EN,,0,0,0,,And tonight, as my...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.03,0:24:38.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,而今夜，作为我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:41.61,EN,,0,0,0,,Don't have to laugh about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:41.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,不用非得笑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.61,0:24:43.83,EN,,0,0,0,,Tonight, as my name enters
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.61,0:24:43.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚，当我的名字进入
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.83,0:24:45.51,EN,,0,0,0,,the Hall of Fame, I'm proud
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.83,0:24:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,名人堂，我很自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.51,0:24:46.27,EN,,0,0,0,,that Switzerland comes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.51,0:24:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,瑞士与我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.27,0:24:47.79,EN,,0,0,0,,with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.27,0:24:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,同行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.79,0:24:48.15,EN,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.79,0:24:48.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.15,0:24:51.65,EN,,0,0,0,,been an incredible journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.15,0:24:51.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,是一段不可思议的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:55.50,EN,,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我而言
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.50,0:24:56.54,EN,,0,0,0,,the International Tennis Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.50,0:24:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,国际网球名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of Fame provides
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,提供了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:58.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a great opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,绝佳的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:24:59.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to look back,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:24:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,回顾过去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.96,0:25:01.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but also to look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.96,0:25:01.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时也展望未来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,As you can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们都看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:03.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm still writing my love letter
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我仍在续写
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.56,0:25:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.56,0:25:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,给网球的情书
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:05.94,EN,,0,0,0,,My time as a player is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.56,0:25:05.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,作为球员我已退役
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.94,0:25:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,but tennis will always stand
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.94,0:25:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,但网球永远会
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,at the intersection of
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我最珍视的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:13.56,EN,,0,0,0,,everything I care most about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,交汇的那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.56,0:25:15.58,EN,,0,0,0,,My family, our friendships,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.56,0:25:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,家人、友情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:17.06,EN,,0,0,0,,the past 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,过去四十年
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:18.46,EN,,0,0,0,,the future we're building,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们构筑的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.46,0:25:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,tennis for me is responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.46,0:25:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球对我而言
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,for it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.68,0:25:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这一切的缘由
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So this is not a goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这不是告别
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.00,0:25:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,But before I close,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.00,0:25:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在结束之前
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to share my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想分享我对这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.08,0:25:27.66,EN,,0,0,0,,for this sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.08,0:25:27.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,的期望
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:28.98,EN,,0,0,0,,The International Tennis Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,国际网球名人堂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.98,0:25:30.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of Fame shows the evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.98,0:25:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,展现了网球的演变
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:32.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of tennis, and I'm honored
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:33.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to be part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.12,0:25:33.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,能成为其中一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.00,0:25:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm incredibly lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.00,0:25:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我无比幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:35.46,EN,,0,0,0,,to have bridged
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.72,0:25:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,能够连接
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.46,0:25:37.24,EN,,0,0,0,,the generations from Pete
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.46,0:25:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,从皮特和安德烈这样的巨星
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:38.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and Andre the superstars
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,到我自己时代
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.50,0:25:41.22,EN,,0,0,0,,to champions in my own age,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.50,0:25:41.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,的冠军们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:43.04,EN,,0,0,0,,like Roddick, Hewitt,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,像罗迪克、休伊特
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.04,0:25:44.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Safin and Ferrero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.04,0:25:44.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨芬和费雷罗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:45.90,EN,,0,0,0,,To the epic rivalries I have
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.44,0:25:45.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,以及我与下一代
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.90,0:25:47.26,EN,,0,0,0,,with the next generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.90,0:25:47.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,之间的史诗对决
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Andy, Novak and Rafa,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,安迪、诺瓦克和拉法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:50.12,EN,,0,0,0,,we all leave
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.58,0:25:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们终究都会离开
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the court eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.12,0:25:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.52,0:25:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but the sport keeps evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.52,0:25:53.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这项运动一直在进化
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:54.98,EN,,0,0,0,,And as the pace of
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:54.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,随着职业网球的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.98,0:25:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,professional tennis speeds up
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.98,0:25:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,不断加快
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.04,0:25:57.94,EN,,0,0,0,,as the sport becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.04,0:25:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,随着这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.94,0:25:59.30,EN,,0,0,0,,even more global,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.94,0:25:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,变得更加全球化
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:01.58,EN,,0,0,0,,I so hope it will keep some
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.30,0:26:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真心希望保留一些
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,of that amateur spirit keep
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.58,0:26:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,那份业余精神，也保留
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the camaraderie
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种情谊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,among the players.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.92,0:26:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在球员当中
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:06.14,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope the players
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:06.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我希望球员们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.14,0:26:07.30,EN,,0,0,0,,will stay young at heart
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.14,0:26:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,永远保持年轻的心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.30,0:26:08.10,EN,,0,0,0,,and stay true
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.30,0:26:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,并忠于
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to their authentic selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,忠于真实的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:11.50,EN,,0,0,0,,And always remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,永远记住
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,never stop asking questions
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不要停止提问
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.14,EN,,0,0,0,,or taking risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,或冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.14,0:26:15.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Do things with the game
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.14,0:26:15.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,去创造这项运动中
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:16.68,EN,,0,0,0,,we've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们从未见过的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:17.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:17.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,继续推动
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.26,0:26:18.18,EN,,0,0,0,,this sport we love
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.26,0:26:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,这项我们热爱的运动
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,迈向新的高度
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.84,0:26:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And keep getting better,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.84,0:26:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且不断进步
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,越来越好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.52,0:26:24.58,EN,,0,0,0,,And I hope, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.52,0:26:24.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也希望如此
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.58,0:26:25.42,EN,,0,0,0,,let's give it a round.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.58,0:26:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们为他们鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.50,0:26:26.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on for the future generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.50,0:26:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了下一代
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:27.56,EN,,0,0,0,,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,鼓掌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:30.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:30.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,一起行动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.90,0:26:32.58,EN,,0,0,0,,And I hope you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.90,0:26:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我希望你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.58,0:26:33.64,EN,,0,0,0,,will find other ways
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.58,0:26:33.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,会找到其他方式
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.64,0:26:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to give something back
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.64,0:26:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,去回馈
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:35.66,EN,,0,0,0,,to share your passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:35.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,分享你的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.66,0:26:37.40,EN,,0,0,0,,There are a thousand ways
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.66,0:26:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,有成千上万种方式
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,可以做到这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,For me it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:39.76,EN,,0,0,0,,was creating a foundation
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是创立一个基金会
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,which does work
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,从事相关工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:42.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in southern Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:42.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在非洲南部
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.20,0:26:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,where mom
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.20,0:26:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,妈妈来自那里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.56,0:26:44.98,EN,,0,0,0,,is from, and Switzerland
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.56,0:26:44.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有瑞士
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.98,0:26:46.76,EN,,0,0,0,,where my dad is from.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.98,0:26:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸的家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:47.78,EN,,0,0,0,,My team and I also created
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:47.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的团队和我还创办了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.78,0:26:49.30,EN,,0,0,0,,the Laver Cup to honor
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.78,0:26:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉沃尔杯，以致敬
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:53.08,EN,,0,0,0,,the legend of all generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,历代传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.20,0:26:56.54,EN,,0,0,0,,And to everyone here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.20,0:26:56.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,对在座每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:57.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope you will be a bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你们架起桥梁
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:26:58.76,EN,,0,0,0,,between the tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:26:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,连接两种网球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:26:59.86,EN,,0,0,0,,that happens at the level
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:26:59.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,一边是职业网球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:01.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of the ATP, WTA,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,ATP、WTA
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.88,0:27:03.10,EN,,0,0,0,,ITF and all the slams
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.88,0:27:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,ITF和所有大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and the tennis that's played
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,另一边是日常网球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:06.56,EN,,0,0,0,,as the sun goes down on a
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:06.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,日落时分仍在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.56,0:27:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,quiet street like Wasserhaus
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.56,0:27:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,瓦瑟豪斯那样安静的街道上
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,where I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是我长大的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:09.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Tennis that's played
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有遍布各地的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.66,0:27:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,everywhere from Switzerland
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.66,0:27:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,从瑞士到南非
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to South Africa, Slovakia,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯洛伐克
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:15.46,EN,,0,0,0,,India and Brazil, anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,印度和巴西，任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that kids draw courts
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,孩子们用粉笔在街上
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in the streets with chalk like I
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.00,0:27:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,画球场，就像我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.00,0:27:20.82,EN,,0,0,0,,did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.00,0:27:20.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前那样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Where they hit against walls
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们对着墙击球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,with borrowed rackets
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,用借来的球拍
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.32,0:27:26.10,EN,,0,0,0,,where parents get the kids
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.32,0:27:26.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,父母带孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.10,0:27:27.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.10,0:27:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,去练球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.40,0:27:28.36,EN,,0,0,0,,where coaches work
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.40,0:27:28.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,教练们辛勤工作
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.36,0:27:29.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and fans show up
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.36,0:27:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,球迷们来到现场
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.66,EN,,0,0,0,,in the blazing sun
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,无论烈日
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.66,0:27:32.70,EN,,0,0,0,,or the bitter cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.66,0:27:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是严寒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.70,0:27:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Where the ball kids
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.70,0:27:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,球童们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:33.94,EN,,0,0,0,,have their knee
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:33.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,单膝跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:35.40,EN,,0,0,0,,on the ground and are ready
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经蓄势待发
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:36.66,EN,,0,0,0,,to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,随时起身跑动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.66,0:27:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I will always see the sport
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.66,0:27:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我总会透过他们的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.52,0:27:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,through their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.52,0:27:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,看待这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.11,0:27:48.13,EN,,0,0,0,,So this boy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.11,0:27:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这个巴塞尔的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:49.53,EN,,0,0,0,,from Basel thanks you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.53,0:27:50.57,EN,,0,0,0,,for the incredible honor
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.53,0:27:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢这无上的荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.65,EN,,0,0,0,,and I thank you, all of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.57,0:27:52.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们，谢谢在座各位
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.65,0:27:53.55,EN,,0,0,0,,for sharing the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.65,0:27:53.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们一路相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.55,0:27:56.05,EN,,0,0,0,,that brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.55,0:27:56.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这段旅程让我们相聚
